      "description": "A todo list you can keep in the right rail. It stores its items in the plugin's own data directory, so they survive a restart and a disable/enable cycle.",
      "readme": "Todo is the smallest useful plugin: one panel, one list, one file.\n\nAdd an item with the field at the top, tick it off, filter by All / Active / Done, and clear the finished ones. The list is written to `vibex-settings.json` in the plugin's data directory.\n\nIt asks for `ui.panel` (a place in the right rail) and `storage` (a file of its own), and nothing else."
